    "# 07 Deep Q agent with good hyper-parameters\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 👉 Let's use a neural network model to approximate the Q function.\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 👉Neural networks are usually highly-parametric models that are able to fit complex patterns between the input features and the target.\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 👉 The type of neural network we will use is a Multi Layer Perceptron (MLP).\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 👉MLPs are stacks of linear models, interleaved with so called activation functions."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "9fb10d45",
   "metadata": {},
